      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1SA",
          "chapter": 18,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "David behaved himself wisely in all his ways; and the LORD was with him.",
      "ko": "그 모든 일을 지혜롭게 행하니라 여호와께서 그와 함께 계시니라",
      "source_text_hash": "107d1e5cdb61b2b36d8f9f44b7fefa66932b139c1660be44896d1361608f999a",
